1
00:00:06,003 --> 00:00:07,933
(Raj:)If you look carefully at Venus...

2
00:00:08,105 --> 00:00:12,235
(Raj:)...you should be able to see
the International Space Station pass by.

3
00:00:12,410 --> 00:00:15,400
(Lucy:)Wow, your friend was actually up there?

4
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:18,050
(Raj:)Yeah, he brought me back
a T-shirt that said:

5
00:00:18,216 --> 00:00:22,416
"My Friend Went to the Space Station
and All I Got Was This Lousy T-shirt."

6
00:00:23,487 --> 00:00:25,117
(Lucy:)Did he take the T-shirt to space?

7
00:00:25,289 --> 00:00:27,779
(Raj:)Nope. It's exactly as lousy as advertised.

8
00:00:29,594 --> 00:00:33,034
(Raj:)Speaking of friends,
they have been asking to meet you.

9
00:00:33,931 --> 00:00:36,961
(Raj:)I was thinking maybe
we could all hang out sometime?

10
00:00:37,134 --> 00:00:38,934
(Lucy:)I don't know, how many are there?

11
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:41,460
(Raj:)Let's see. Six.

12
00:00:41,639 --> 00:00:43,939
(Raj:)That's pretty cool. I have six friends.

13
00:00:46,043 --> 00:00:48,033
I'm kind of like Sinatra.

14
00:00:49,947 --> 00:00:52,777
Six strangers, that's a lot of pressure.

15
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:57,220
(Lucy:)Staring at me, asking me
personal questions like, "What do you do?

16
00:00:57,655 --> 00:01:02,025
(Lucy:)Where are you from? Why did you
lock yourself in the bathroom?"

